uses: codegen
uses: jev

Plan, add, and build .module applications.
Parse and write module files under the configured code root.
Cover missing behaviors with Jev, repair cycles, and build modules in dependency order.
Report per-module build status for /modules and before and after /build.
Support /build <name> for one module when dependencies are already adopted.
Call mechanicus.lifecycle for spec, adopt, and write_adopted during build.
